# The count of resolutions starts over each turn (CR 608.2): on turn 1 an Elf enters (the first resolution of that turn), and
# on turn 3 another enters, which is again the first resolution of its turn. Only the Connoisseur gains deathtouch then;
# the earlier Elf, which would be in the second-resolution group had the count carried over, gains nothing.

